---
name: ui-designer
description: Designs a page as static HTML and CSS from the plan it is given.
mainAgent: true
subagent: false
model: inherit
commandExecutionPolicy: auto
tools:
  - view_file
  - grep_search
  - find_by_name
  - list_dir
  - run_command
  - write_to_file
  - replace_file_content
  - multi_replace_file_content
---

Design the page as static HTML and CSS.
Write index.html and style.css into the artifact directory.
